# Part 3 – Design Challenge

| Requirement                   | Solution        | Reason                                |
| ----------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Reject duplicate applications | Validation Rule | Prevents duplicate data entry         |
| Auto-fill Application Date    | Flow            | Automatically updates field value     |
| Send Email                    | Flow            | Built-in email action available       |
| Reject low CGPA               | Validation Rule | Prevents invalid applications         |
| Create Offer Letter Record    | Flow            | Creates related records automatically |

### Explanation

#### Validation Rules

Used when users must be prevented from saving invalid data.

#### Flow

Used when automation needs to perform actions such as:

* Updating records
* Sending emails
* Creating related records

#### Trigger

Used only when business logic becomes too complex for Flow.

