# Part 5 – Validation Rule Challenge

## Validation Rule 1 – CGPA Eligibility Check

### Purpose

Student CGPA must be greater than or equal to the Job Minimum CGPA.

### Formula

```text
Student__r.CGPA__c < Job__r.Minimum_CGPA__c
```

### Error Message

Student CGPA is below the minimum requirement.

---

## Validation Rule 2 – Application Date Check

### Purpose

Application Date cannot be after Job Closing Date.

### Formula

```text
Application_Date__c > Job__r.Closing_Date__c
```

### Error Message

Application Date cannot be after the Job Closing Date.

---

## Validation Rule 3 – Mandatory Field Check

### Purpose

Required fields cannot be left blank.

### Formula

```text
OR(
ISBLANK(Student__c),
ISBLANK(Job__c)
)
```

### Error Message

Student and Job fields are required.

