# Part 6 – Trigger vs Flow Debate

## 1. Update a Field Automatically

### Solution

Flow

### Reason

Simple automation without code.

---

## 2. Create a Related Record

### Solution

Flow

### Reason

Flows can create records easily using Create Records action.

---

## 3. Send Email Notification

### Solution

Flow

### Reason

Built-in Email Action available.

---

## 4. Call an External REST API

### Solution

Trigger + Apex

### Reason

External integrations typically require Apex callouts.

---

## 5. Perform Complex Calculations Involving Multiple Objects

### Solution

Trigger + Apex

### Reason

Complex logic is easier to manage in code.

---

## 6. Process 10,000 Imported Records

### Solution

Trigger + Apex

### Reason

Apex provides better control over bulk processing and governor limits.

